    return i2c_bad.scan()
Correct:
import board, busio
i2c = busio.I2C(board.SCL, board.SDA)
def scan():
    while not i2c.try_lock():
        pass
    try:
        return i2c.scan()
    finally:
        i2c.unlock()
Complexity: O(1)

