TypeScript Weighted Graph
A training document for the DSA Mentor RAG collection. It teaches the weighted graph in TypeScript with
a WGraph class and an Edge tuple type: tuple-typed edges, undirected edges, Dijkstra, Bellman-Ford with
negative cycle detection, Prim's minimum spanning tree and Floyd-Warshall. JavaScript and Mnemonist
have no graph class, so it is written here.
