Concept: Date months are zero-based (0 is January) while days and years are not
Misconception: new Date(2024, 3, 1) means March 1st.
Explanation: The month argument and getMonth() run from 0 to 11, so 3 is April. Days of the month start at 1 and getDay() returns 0 for Sunday. Convert a human month with month - 1 and back with getMonth() + 1. This is the most common off-by-one error with Date.
