Concept: peek returns T | undefined; reading a property of it is error TS2532
Misconception: peek() can be used directly when the queue was filled earlier.
Explanation: The queue may be empty, so the type includes undefined and reading peek().p is error TS2532. Check size or use optional chaining. pop has the same type.
