Concept: Optional and rest elements make a tuple flexible, but an optional element can be undefined
Misconception: In [string, number?] the second element is always a number.
Explanation: The ? marks an element that may be missing, so its type is number | undefined, and arithmetic on it is error TS2532. A rest element ([number, ...string[]]) allows any number of trailing items. Handle the optional case with ?? or a check.
