Concept: Conditional types distribute over unions; wrap both sides in a tuple to stop distribution
Misconception: ToArray<string | number> is (string | number)[].
Explanation: A conditional type on a naked type parameter applies to each union member, so ToArray<string | number> is string[] | number[], and a mixed array is error TS2322. Wrapping the check in [T] extends [unknown] disables distribution and gives (string | number)[].
